<title>UK: WestLB unit sets 250 bln lire step-up 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB unit sets 250 bln lire step-up 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Cariplo, Banca Nazionale del Lavoro, San Paolo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTLB FINANCE CURACAO NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ  </p>
<p> AMT    250 BLN LIRE  COUPON   * 6.30 PCT  MATURITY    18.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.455   PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL ON 18.FEB.99 AT PAR AFTER WHICH STEPS UP TO</p>
<p>		6.80 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY     *AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	 *AA+	 DENOMS (M) 5-50 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/IT/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIP     NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		*GUARANTOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
